<fo:block id="W0039-00-0023-it-0bfa" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>5 Vti possidetis.</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0039-00-0023-it-0bfb" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>5 Vtrobi.</fo:block>
