<fo:block id="W0039-00-0023-it-0c0a" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>3 Ad exhibendum.</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0039-00-0023-it-0c0b" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>3 Alee vsu <fo:inline font-weight="normal">et</fo:inline> aleatoribus.</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0039-00-0023-it-0c0c" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>4 Actionibus <fo:inline font-weight="normal">et</fo:inline> obligationibus.</fo:block>
