<fo:inline> </fo:inline>cantis.</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0039-00-0038-it-10cd" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>4 Conditionibus appositis in matrimo
<fo:inline> </fo:inline>nio.</fo:block>
