				2] </fo:inline>sʒ non ad salutẽ nisi dispositiue.</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0039-00-0153-pa-0700" text-align="justify" font-size="12pt" text-indent="0em"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>¶ Vtrũ matrimoniũ teneatꝑ coactonẽ
