<fo:block id="W0039-00-0201-pa-0827" text-align="justify" font-size="12pt" text-indent="0em"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>¶ Quinto requiritur ẜʒ Jnno. in. c. prudẽtia de offic. deleg. ꝙ illud quod quis
