<fo:block id="W0039-00-0230-pa-08d0" text-align="justify" font-size="12pt" text-indent="0em"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>¶ Que ẽ remuneratio fideliter soluen<fo:inline id="W0039-00-0230-mi-07e2" font-style="normal" font-weight="bold" font-size="10pt"> [sect.
				20] </fo:inline>tiũ decimas. Rñ. ꝙ multiplex. prĩa habundantia fructuum. Sca sanitas de
