<fo:block id="W0039-00-0276-pa-09e6" text-align="justify" font-size="12pt" text-indent="0em"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Adde de his <fo:inline font-weight="normal">et</fo:inline> ꝙ ebrius pro dilecto
