<fo:block id="W0039-00-0362-pa-0c54" text-align="justify" font-size="12pt" text-indent="0em"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>¶ Sextodecimo nō pōt constitui ꝓcu<fo:inline id="W0039-00-0362-mi-0ad3" font-style="normal" font-weight="bold" font-size="10pt"> [sect.
