<fo:block id="W0039-00-0370-pa-0c7c" text-align="justify" font-size="12pt" text-indent="0em"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>¶ Vtrũ pẽdẽte lite suꝑ validitate pri<fo:inline id="W0039-00-0370-mi-0af4" font-style="normal" font-weight="bold" font-size="10pt"> [sect.
