<fo:block text-align="justify" font-size="16pt" font-weight="bold" space-before="20pt" text-indent="0em" keep-with-next="always"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-size="18pt" space-before="0.1mm" space-after="0.1mm">Exemplum</fo:inline></fo:block> <fo:block id="W0039-00-0371-pa-0c86" text-align="justify" font-size="12pt" text-indent="0em">malum dantes precipue prelati. <fo:inline font-weight="normal">et</fo:inline> q̇ habẽt
