<fo:block id="W0039-00-0760-pa-1866" text-align="justify" font-size="12pt" text-indent="0em"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>¶ Quarto modo dicit̃ periurium affir<fo:inline id="W0039-00-0760-mi-12d7" font-style="normal" font-weight="bold" font-size="10pt"> [sect.
				3] </fo:inline>matio dubitationis vt cũ quis illud de
