				19] </fo:inline>Rñ. ꝙ nō nullo tꝑe. l. pignori rem acceptam. ff. de vsucapio.</fo:block></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0039-00-0767-d3-0963"><fo:block text-align="justify" font-size="16pt" font-weight="bold" space-before="20pt" text-indent="0em" keep-with-next="always"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-size="18pt" space-before="0.1mm" space-after="0.1mm">Pigritia</fo:inline></fo:block> <fo:block id="W0039-00-0767-pa-1895" text-align="justify" font-size="12pt" text-indent="0em">est quedā tarditas ad exe
