<fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-size="18pt" space-before="0.1mm" space-after="0.1mm">Rescriptum</fo:inline></fo:block> <fo:block id="W0039-00-0822-pa-19cd" text-align="justify" font-size="12pt" text-indent="0em">proprie est id ꝙ prin
