<fo:inline> </fo:inline>de spon.</fo:block></fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0039-00-0903-d3-09ea"><fo:block text-align="justify" font-size="16pt" font-weight="bold" space-before="20pt" text-indent="0em" keep-with-next="always"><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-size="18pt" space-before="0.1mm" space-after="0.1mm">Statutum</fo:inline></fo:block> <fo:block id="W0039-00-0903-pa-1c2c" text-align="justify" font-size="12pt" text-indent="0em">Quis potest facere. Rñ.
<fo:inline> </fo:inline>ꝙ ille quis potest facere legem. de quo vide. s̃. Lex §. ij.</fo:block>
<fo:block id="W0039-00-0903-pa-1c2d" text-align="justify" font-size="12pt" text-indent="0em"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>¶ Vtrum statutuʒ ordinarij licet extra
